n of 8 years</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Editor and mods</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switchcars includes an in-game editor, where you can create your own vehicles and props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community has created over 2000 additional vehicles and props, so far. Check them out on our Discord server!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/442210/extras/d969b9fbfdd4f65da82d6c3d473328f9.poster.avif?t=1771798166\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/442210/extras/d969b9fbfdd4f65da82d6c3d473328f9.webm?t=1771798166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/442210/extras/d969b9fbfdd4f65da82d6c3d473328f9.mp4?t=1771798166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
